    sf32lb52_devkit_lcd: import sf32lb52 board overlay (squash of PR #6)

    Squash-merge of upstream/sf32lb52-fix-split into dev-ai-contest-2026.
    Brings in the full SF32LB52 chip-side support and the
    sf32lb52_devkit_lcd board overlay so the AI contest 2026 branch is
    self-contained and buildable for the SiFli sf32lb52_devkit_lcd
    board.

    Original 37 upstream commits are squashed into this single import
    commit; see open-vela/vendor_sifli#6 (sf32lb52-fix-split,
    HEAD 8824a21bdc2b) for the per-commit history.

    Brings up:
      * boards/sf32lb52/sf32lb52_devkit_lcd        - board overlay
      * boards/sf32lb52/drivers/{lcd,input}        - LCD / FT6146 touch
      * chips/sf32lb52                             - chip support
      * chips/drivers (HAL, Include, cmsis ports)  - SiFli HAL drop-in

    Tested on a real sf32lb52_devkit_lcd V1.2.1 board: see PR
    description for the full xTS / per-peripheral self-test log.

    Signed-off-by: v-yanxingyu <v-yanxingyu@xiaomi.com>

